0,Hindko - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hindko,"3 weeks ago - The name ""Hindko"" means ""the Indian language"" or ""language of Hind"", and refers to the Indo-Aryan speech forms spoken in the northern Indian subcontinent, in contrast to the neighbouring Pashto, an Iranic language spoken by the Pashtun people. An alternative local name for this language group ...","Hindko, Southern",Indo-European
